  "content": "[Intro]\n[C]\nTo\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]dream the impossible\n[Em]dream To\n[F]fight the unbeatable\n[Am]foe To\n[Em]bear with unbearable\n[F]sorrow To\n[Dm]run where the brave dare not\n[G]go\n[C]To right the unrightable\n[Em]wrong To\n[F]be better far than you\n[Am]are To\n[Em]try when your arms are too\n[F]weary To\n[Dm]reach the unreachable\n[G]stars This is my\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]quest, to follow that\n[Am]star No matter how\n[Em]hopeless, no matter how\n[F]far To fight for the\n[Am]right without question or\n[G#]pause To be willing to\n[C]march into hell [Am]for a heavenly\n[Bb/D]cause And I\n[Dm]know if I'll only be\n[Bb/D]true to this glorious\n[E]quest That my\n[F]heart will lie peaceful and\n[Dm]calm When I'm laid to my\n[Fm]rest\n[G]And the\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C]world will be better for\n[Em]this That one\n[F]man scorned and covered with\n[Am]scars Still\n[Em]strove with his last ounce of\n[F]courage To\n[C]reach the unreachable\n[Ab]star And the\n\n[Chorus]\n[Db]world will be better for\n[Db7M]this That one\n[Gb]man scorned and covered with\nscars Still\n[Fm]strove with his last ounce of\n[Gb]courage To\n[Gb]reach the\n[Db]unreachable\n[Db]star",
